('Grove','UK · Margate','A','https://madebygrove.co.uk/products/rustic-solid-wood-desk','https://madebygrove.co.uk/pages/our-story','hello@madebygrove.co.uk','Made-to-order desks offer size and leg options; exact custom widths are available on request.','Preview the proportions of one rectangular desk across approved sizes.','Match the maker’s 74cm height and real leg styles; do not present the generic demo as their product.','I saw that Grove builds desks to customers’ measurements, with several depths and leg styles. Could a 3D preview help shoppers compare proportions before contacting your workshop?'),
('Celtic Timber','UK · Pembrokeshire','A','https://www.celtictimber.co.uk/collections/furniture/products/solid-oak-hairpin-desk','https://www.celtictimber.co.uk/pages/contact','info@celtictimber.co.uk','Oak hairpin desk offers size/finish choices and bespoke dimensions on request.','Let shoppers explore dimensions and oil finish before sending a bespoke request.','A simple hairpin-leg geometry must replace the demo frame; price and constraints require approval.','Your oak hairpin desk page offers standard sizes and bespoke dimensions. Would an interactive preview plus a structured bespoke-size brief be useful for those enquiries?'),
('RCC Furniture','UK · Sheffield','A','https://www.rcc-furniture.com/','https://www.rcc-furniture.com/contact','info@rcc-furniture.co.uk','Workshop advertises made-to-measure desks and furniture with custom size, style and finish.','Pick one repeatable rectangular desk instead of the whole furniture catalogue.','Website is led by dining furniture; first establish the importance of desk enquiries.','I noticed RCC makes desks and other furniture to customers’ size, style and finish. Is there one repeatable desk design where customers often need help choosing dimensions?'),
('Masterplank UK','UK · Shrewsbury','A','https://masterplankuk.com/products/rustic-office-desk','https://masterplankuk.com/policies/contact-information','sales@masterplankuk.com','Offers a box-frame office desk and describes bespoke made-to-order sizing.','Pilot the rectangular box-frame model with size and stain controls.','Corner desks and adjustable mechanisms are outside this fixed-scope pilot.','I found your rustic office desk with box-frame legs and your bespoke-size service. Would customers benefit from previewing one rectangular desk in different sizes and finishes before requesting a quote?'),
('Woodeye Furniture','UK · Edinburgh','B','https://www.woodeyefurniture.co.uk/bespoke-desks/','https://www.woodeyefurniture.co.uk/bespoke-desks/','Public phone: 07867 515 097; contact via website','Bespoke desk page describes a handmade Dowally Desk and optional custom features.','Test whether a simplified repeatable design could generate clearer briefs.','Recent indexed source supports fit; direct fetch hit a verification page. Recheck operation manually; rack-mount details require separate scope.','I came across the Dowally Desk and your bespoke desk work. Would a simple interactive version of one design help clients explain their preferred size and finish before a consultation?'),
('Sorrell & Smith','UK · Essex','B','https://www.sorrell-smith.co.uk/live-edge-desks/','https://www.sorrell-smith.co.uk/live-edge-desks/','Website Request a Quote / Contact links; phone 01245 79 0182','Bespoke desk page offers dimensions on request and mentions square-edge alternatives to live-edge desks.','Offer a square-edge concept and a clear dimensions/material brief.','Unique slab/live-edge visualization is outside the pilot; require a repeatable square-edge product to qualify.','Your desk page mentions bespoke dimensions and square-edge options as well as live-edge pieces. Would a simple square-edge desk configurator be worth exploring for initial customer briefs?'),
('Szimpel Woodwork','UK · Edinburgh','B','https://szimpelwoodwork.co.uk/','https://szimpelwoodwork.co.uk/','hello@szimpelwoodwork.co.uk','Independent workshop offers made-to-order desks and asks customers to share dimensions and material preferences.','Use one repeatable desk concept to collect initial dimensions and materials.','Fully unique commissions may not justify a configurator; establish repeat demand and budget first.','I saw that you make custom desks and start commissions by discussing dimensions, style and timber. Is there a desk design you repeat often enough that an interactive starting brief could help?'),
('Spiritcraft / Tablemakers','USA · East Dundee, Illinois','B','https://www.tablemakers.com/product/custom-made-solid-wood-desk-desktop-builder','https://www.tablemakers.com/','Public phone: 224-801-1969; use website contact route','Desk builder already lists lengths, widths, hardwoods, stain, legs and grommet options.','Explore a visual layer for one subset of the existing option builder.','Existing configurator means integration questions come first. No claim that the existing tool lacks 3D; embedding/cart work requires separate scope.','Your desk builder has a substantial range of hardwood, size, stain and base choices. Are you exploring interactive visualization for any part of that selection process?'),
